    'M12 2.5 14.2 7.8 18 4.2 17.1 9.8 22 9.2 17.8 13 21.5 16.8 16 15.9 16.5 21.5 12 17.7 7.5 21.5 8 15.9 2.5 16.8 6.2 13 2 9.2 6.9 9.8 6 4.2 9.8 7.8 12 2.5Z',
